1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:00,994
In movies,
soldiers pull

2
00:00:00,994 --> 00:00:02,136
a grenade pin
with their teeth—

3
00:00:02,136 --> 00:00:03,200
that would rip
your teeth out,

4
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,456
and it doesn't even
start the timer!

5
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:05,650
Watch what happens

6
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:06,650
the second
he throws it—

7
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:08,040
inside, a coiled
steel spring is

8
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,466
locked down
by this curved spoon.

9
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,211
The instant
it leaves his hand,

10
00:00:11,211 --> 00:00:12,068
the spoon flies off—

11
00:00:12,068 --> 00:00:13,217
and a steel
striker hammer

12
00:00:13,217 --> 00:00:14,453
slams
into the brass primer!

13
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:16,865
That spark lights a
four-second delay fuse—

14
00:00:16,865 --> 00:00:18,398
burning steadily
down the center

15
00:00:18,398 --> 00:00:20,068
as it flies toward
the enemy bunker!

16
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,164
The moment it lands
by the sandbags,

17
00:00:22,164 --> 00:00:23,140
the flame
hits the core—

18
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,262
and superheated
gas swells

19
00:00:24,262 --> 00:00:25,165
to extreme pressure!

20
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:27,376
In a millisecond,
the pre-scored cast-iron

21
00:00:27,376 --> 00:00:28,396
shell shatters outward

22
00:00:28,396 --> 00:00:29,482
in a massive shockwave!
